    "html": "<section class=\"lu-claro\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;color:#151515;--rosa:#C8661F;--paper:#151515;--muted:#8A8580;--soft:#4A4744;--g1:#F4F1EC;--line:#E7E2DB\"><style>.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card-r,.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pill-r{background:#FFC48F}.pm .pm-lienzo .lu-claro .pm-card{box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}</style><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500;600;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,600&display=swap');</style><p class=\"abs a pm-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;--d:0\">Guion 15 de 19 · Educación</p><div class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:128px;top:166px;padding:4px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFC48F;color:#151515;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:0\">Enseñar</div><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:300px;top:168px;width:600px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;--d:0\">Serie: Nivel 0</p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:128px;top:214px;width:1180px;font-size:40px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;--d:1\">«Tu glúteo no es solo estética: es lo que te levanta de la silla»</p><p class=\"abs a rosa\" style=\"left:128px;top:360px;width:700px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:2\">0-2 s · Lo que se ve</p><p class=\"abs a soft\" style=\"left:128px;top:394px;width:1180px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;--d:2\">Te levantas de una silla y subes unas escaleras, con el glúteo marcado en pantalla.</p><p class=\"abs a rosa\" style=\"left:128px;top:480px;width:700px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:3\">Desarrollo</p><div class=\"abs a\" style=\"left:128px;top:516px;width:1180px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;--d:3\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:38px;text-indent:-38px\"><span style=\"font-weight:800;display:inline-block;width:38px;text-indent:0;color:var(--rosa)\">•</span><b>Levantarte de la silla</b> → sentadilla a silla.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:38px;text-indent:-38px\"><span style=\"font-weight:800;display:inline-block;width:38px;text-indent:0;color:var(--rosa)\">•</span><b>Subir escaleras</b> → subida a escalón.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:38px;text-indent:-38px\"><span style=\"font-weight:800;display:inline-block;width:38px;text-indent:0;color:var(--rosa)\">•</span><b>Caminar sin dolor</b> → puente de glúteo.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:38px;text-indent:-38px\"><span style=\"font-weight:800;display:inline-block;width:38px;text-indent:0;color:var(--rosa)\">•</span>Un ejercicio por situación, 5 segundos cada uno.</p></div><p class=\"abs a rosa\" style=\"left:128px;top:760px;width:700px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;--d:4\">Cierre</p><p class=\"abs a \" style=\"left:128px;top:794px;width:1180px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;--d:4\">Texto: «Guárdalo para tu próximo entreno».</p><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:128px;top:880px;width:1180px;padding:18px 26px;border-radius:18px;background:#F7F3EE;border-left:6px solid #FFC48F;--d:5\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8661F\">Por qué funciona</span><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#3A3836\">Une lo que buscan (estética) con lo que necesitan (salud), y cada situación es una escena cotidiana.</span></div><div class=\"abs pop\" style=\"left:1440px;top:120px;width:352px;height:626px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:#ddd url(https://levelup.luciaentrenadorapersonal.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Sobre-Lucia-scaled.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(21,31,48,.22);--d:2\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(21,31,48,0) 38%,rgba(21,31,48,.78) 82%)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:25px;top:125px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFCB9A;color:#151F30;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase\">Nivel 0</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:25px;right:25px;top:351px;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:31px;line-height:1.02;color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Tu glúteo:<br><span style=\"color:#FFCB9A\">más que estética</span></div></div><p class=\"abs a muted\" style=\"left:1440px;top:760px;width:352px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;--d:3\">Portada · 20-25 s</p><div class=\"foot\" style=\"left:128px;\"><span>Maen Studios × Level Up Workout</span><span class=\"n\">17</span></div></section>"
